    "fact": "f1",
    "display": "300 mi",
    "caption": "The principal islands are about 300 mi east of South America’s southern Patagonian coast and 752 mi from Cape Dubouzet at the northern tip of the Antarctic Peninsula, at a latitude of about 52°S."
